<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch post Dfl 2.4 billion June trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Dutch post Dfl 2.4 billion June trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch trade surplus narrowed to a provisional 2.40 billion guilders in June from 2.64 billion in May, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.  </p>
<p>DUTCH TRADE BALANCE    June 96	May 96	 June 95</p>
<p> exports		    26.15	  26.88	  27.76</p>
<p> imports		    23.75	  24.24	  25.12</p>
<p> trade balance	    +2.40	  +2.64	  +2.63</p>
<p>NOTE - Merchandise trade in billions of guilders.</p>
</text>
